  "description": "Plus Timothy's Positions Update",
  "body_html": "<p>What a wonderful first month in the stock market going into 2026! This is a heads up that more buy alerts were triggered this morning. I emphasized that legacy finance stocks were on my radar in the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF Build Video</a>, and we picked up our first batch of assets yesterday: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/going-shopping-3-finance-stocks-im?r=4z8lgl\">3 Stocks I am Buying</a>.</p><p><strong>Today, 2 more stocks triggered buy alerts, no shock, in the legacy finance sector.</strong> Thus far the positions we picked up yesterday are continuing their move up. You can see our positions performance for 2026 thus far. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MV3Z!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7504a220-89e2-40c7-b2bc-bd8e57b942ac_866x292.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MV3Z!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7504a220-89e2-40c7-b2bc-bd8e57b942ac_866x292.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MV3Z!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7504a220-89e2-40c7-b2bc-bd8e57b942ac_866x292.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MV3Z!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7504a220-89e2-40c7-b2bc-bd8e57b942ac_866x292.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MV3Z!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.ama